README.md:98:`terradish_folds()` constructs folds; `terradish_cv_folds()` keeps the landscape graph fixed while withholding sites. It accepts per-formula conductance factories and repeated folds. Reprofiled nuisance parameters compare conductance formulas under one measurement model. Set `nuisance = "fixed"` to retain every measurement parameter from training and score predictive densities when comparing measurement extensions.
